impl FadeShape {
    /// The gain at progress `u`, clamped to 0..1: Linear `u`, S-curve
    /// `(1 − cos πu)/2`, +3 dB `sin(uπ/2)`, −3 dB `1 − cos(uπ/2)`. Each runs
